{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04011","headline":"晦日宴高氏林亭 · 周思钧","name":"晦日宴高氏林亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"早春惊柳穟，初晦掩蓂华。\n骑出平阳里，筵开衞尉家。\n竹影含云密，池纹带雨斜。\n重惜林亭晚，上路满烟霞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"周思钧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04011.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04011","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}